  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\text { Hints: } \\begin{aligned}\n& x^2-2 \\sqrt{3}-22=0 \\\\\n& D=12+(4 \\times 22)>0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n$\\because$ coeffs are irrational,\n$$\nx=\\frac{2 \\sqrt{3} \\pm \\sqrt{12+88}}{2}\n$$\n$\\therefore$ Roots are irrational, real, unequal.",
